<description>&lt;p&gt;Ethiopian forces are fighting Eritrean-backed fighters in Gemalo near Badme and have shelled Alamata, while Somali militants attacked an Ethiopian base, killing 43 soldiers. Prime Minister Abiy Ahmed warned Eritrea to stop supporting Ethiopia's enemies and reiterated that Ethiopia will not invade Eritrea. Kenyan trucks were escorted across the volatile Moyale border and Ethiopian troops resumed flights to Aksum. The conflict produced 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New Arab&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxNZHFvZ0NYUE9DXzdlVXNhSl9SZ1JreUdCTGppc2t1YWl2SUtQYlljY3JqeXdteEF6YVpKNWVtV3FJRjMxazc4b3VoTVBGLUE4azVPbHBCSlFua3NFM1Z0UGxzZnI5OGNOT3hIWHU3akR0d201NGw2ckxPX0tPamY0SzV4VXdTZ1MwRENCejNvcDRKaDZMdGhUcUx3RVpwWXRuRHpCYzJpYUpuTFYtSHAxUGFsSHRvQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The EastAfrican&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUkFVX3lxTE1IaGEtRTk0OERvTHJOQ2dTZUZpbzczcDljV0tKZHhNZ1ZpMV9kTHRzN2ZKbWNTVl9XRGdLVG5nOGlXTGlKcWI3bEd5ZVpWZjRBVFE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Addis Standard&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMic0FVX3lxTE1KOXlMTFlxZWNaSk93RTdreno3UktCVDVmcHVwT3dyZkJJWGZaU2hET2RkQ0VmNzhHb244SlZyQVNYbHYzU25WOWtMRWpudkt0WjlKZkFacnZLMGtmU2EtV1FtMENVYTZwRUxFUE1FdmFYZkU?oc=5&quot;&gt;DNE Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxQRXRpcGk3RnhKX1oxNlQ4YXBmZUVDQ2JSVW1ZcG1ZNV94ZlU1TW9EY2luNlpYaUlPTmZRVE1LSnQ5NFZKZjdBM3lpQWRVMktKVm1fVUhFMTRVRnY2SURlTWdzNTk2eGRJNjRrNGx1WjA2SWpzUG9XbW85NXdRRWxzeXFtdklDLTdvOVBYdHNBWWVNU2pJSGd5TklHZEZFNzBvTXp4VUZ6LTVTcHd4?oc=5&quot;&gt;Ethiopia Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZ0FVX3lxTE44QlNjM3JaMlY5c3BXV2YzTEN2SHl1Tk5rMmV4bTFQREg4a1VIeVEzQ3FxT